  "description": "<html>\n        <head>\n        \n        </head>\n        <body >\n        <div style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#111827; max-width:980px; margin:0 auto;\">\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:18px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:18px; font-weight:700; color:#111827;\">📚 Re:Zero - Starting Life in Another World Light Novel Vol. 1–28 English Version – Brand New, Sealed &amp; Wrapped – FULL SET</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:0; color:#374151;\">Enjoy <strong>Re:Zero - Starting Life in Another World</strong> in English with this <strong>Vol. 1–28 Full Set</strong>, including the newest release Vol. 27 and Vol. 28. This light novel set is suitable for readers, casual fans, first-time light novel buyers, and anyone who wants an affordable way to enjoy the series in physical print.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#fef2f2; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:16px; color:#991b1b;\">⚠️ Important Edition Notice – Please Read Before Buying</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">This is a <strong>local / underground / Southeast Asian market reading edition</strong>. It is made for affordable personal reading and enjoyment.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">This is <strong>NOT an official publisher edition</strong> and is not from Viz Media, Square Enix, Kodansha, Yen Press, Tokyopop, Vertical, or similar official producers.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">This edition is <strong>not suitable for collectors</strong>. It is more suitable for first-time readers, casual readers, fans, and pleasure reading. Official editions usually cost more.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">Minor print, trim, colour, paper, cover, binding, jacket, spine, book size, or finishing variations may occur between batches, especially when books come from different printing batches or publishers.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">✨ Quick Highlights</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:#eef2ff; color:#3730a3; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">Vol. 1–28</span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:#ecfeff; color:#155e75; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">English Version</span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:#f0fdf4; color:#166534; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">Brand New, Sealed &amp; Wrapped</span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:#fff7ed; color:#9a3412; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">Malaysian Reading Edition</span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:#fdf2f8; color:#9d174d; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">FULL SET</span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:#f9fafb; color:#374151; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">Tracked Shipping Available</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">📖 Story Overview</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Re:Zero - Starting Life in Another World</strong> follows Subaru Natsuki, a young man who suddenly finds himself transported into a fantasy world filled with magic, unfamiliar people, and many unexpected challenges.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;\">As Subaru meets characters such as Emilia, Rem, Beatrice, and others, he becomes involved in royal matters, supernatural conflicts, and difficult choices that test his courage, loyalty, and determination.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">Across Volumes 1–28, the story combines fantasy adventure, mystery, character growth, emotional drama, and detailed worldbuilding, making it a strong choice for readers who enjoy immersive light novels with an ongoing story and memorable characters.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">📌 Key Details</h3>\n    <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;\">\n      <tbody><tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700; width:35%;\">Title / Series</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Re:Zero - Starting Life in Another World</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Volumes</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Vol. 1–28, including newest release Vol. 27 and Vol. 28</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Set Type</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">FULL SET</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Language</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">English Version</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Author / Artist</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Tappei Nagatsuki</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Genre</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Supernatural, Light Novel</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Format</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Black &amp; White Paperback Light Novel Books</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Condition</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Brand New, Sealed &amp; Wrapped</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Publisher / Printing</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Malaysian Publisher / Local Underground Reading Edition</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:700;\">Intended Use</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Affordable reading, casual fans, first-time readers, light novel fans, and pleasure reading</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px; font-weight:700;\">Shipping</td>\n        <td style=\"padding:7px 8px;\">Tracked shipping available</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">✅ Edition &amp; Quality Notes</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;\">This is a budget-friendly local reading edition made for customers who want to enjoy the story in physical print without paying the higher price usually required for official publisher editions.</p>\n    <ul style=\"margin:0 0 10px 20px; padding:0;\">\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Paperback light novel format is suitable for normal reading and personal enjoyment.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">English text is provided for easy reading.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Printing, trimming, paper texture, cover finish, colour tone, book size, spine design, binding, jacket, or finishing may vary slightly between batches.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p style=\"margin:0; color:#6b7280; font-size:12.5px;\">Collector warning: This local reading edition is not recommended for collectors who require official publisher copies, exact print quality, official ISBN matching, or premium collectible finishing.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">🎨 Colour &amp; Display Note</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">Actual book colour, cover shade, print tone, spine appearance, and finishing may look slightly different from the photos due to monitor settings, lighting conditions, camera exposure, and batch production differences.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">📦 Packaging &amp; Protection</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Books are grouped securely before shipping to help reduce movement during transit.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Bubble wrap or protective material is used where needed.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">Sturdy outer packaging is used to help protect the books during delivery.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">📝 Important Buyer Notes</h3>\n    <ul style=\"margin:0 0 0 20px; padding:0;\">\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">This is a local reading edition, not an official publisher edition.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Not suitable for collectors who require official publisher copies or premium collectible finishing.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Official editions usually cost more.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Please message before buying if you are unsure about the edition, quality, or included volumes.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">Please confirm the set type and volume range before purchase.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">🚚 Shipping</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Orders will be packed securely and shipped with tracking where applicable.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Please make sure your shipping address is correct before placing the order.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">Delivery time may vary depending on destination, courier handling, customs processing, local delivery service, and seasonal volume.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">↩️ Returns</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Returns are accepted according to the return policy shown on this eBay listing.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">Item must be returned in the same condition received. Please contact us first if there is any issue with your order.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">⭐ Feedback</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Your satisfaction is important to us. If you are happy with your purchase, positive feedback is greatly appreciated.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">If there is any problem with your order, please contact us before leaving feedback so we can assist you.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:0;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:16px;\">💬 Contact Us</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">Please message us through eBay if you have any questions about the item, volume range, set type, edition type, shipping, specific volume request, or bulk purchase availability. We will try our best to help.</p>\n  </section>\n\n</div>\n<!-- END: Comic Description – Re:Zero - Starting Life in Another World -->\n\n<!-- Start: eBay Listing Info Block (Alt Template v2) -->\n<div aria-label=\"Listing information\" role=\"region\" style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#111827; line-height:1.6; font-size:14px;\">\n\n  <!-- Top Notice: US Duties & Taxes -->\n  <div style=\"background:#FFF7ED; border:1px solid #FDBA74; border-radius:12px; padding:14px 16px; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:900; font-size:18px; letter-spacing:.2px; color:#9A3412;\">IMPORTANT FOR US BUYERS\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13px; color:#7C2D12; margin-top:6px;\">\n      <b>Import duties, taxes and carrier fees are <u>not included</u> in the item price or postage.</b>\n      You may be contacted by the courier or US Customs to pay these before delivery. We do not collect these fees at checkout.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Highlight Row -->\n  <div style=\"margin: 0px -4px 12px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; margin:4px; padding:8px 12px; border:1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius:999px; background:#F8FAFC; font-weight:700;\">* Dispatch 24-48 business hrs*</span>\n<span style=\"display:inline-block; margin:4px; padding:8px 12px; border:1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius:999px; background:#F0F9FF; font-weight:700;\">* Tracked service on all orders</span>\n<span st