n            <div style=\"font-weight:800; color:#D97706;\">Customs &amp; Taxes</div>\n          </div>\n          <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px;\">\n            <li>Check your country's import rules before purchasing.</li>\n            <li><b>Duties/VAT/taxes/carrier fees are not included</b> in price or postage; the <b>buyer pays</b> these when required.</li>\n            <li>Customs inspection or fee collection may extend delivery time.</li>\n            <li><b>US buyers:</b> Courier/US Customs may contact you to settle fees prior to delivery.</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px; background:#FFFBEB; border:1px dashed #F59E0B; padding:10px; border-radius:10px; font-size:13px; color:#78350F;\">\n            Tip: Respond promptly to any carrier/customs messages to avoid delays.\n          </div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <!-- Card 3: Returns -->\n        <td style=\"width:50%; vertical-align:top; background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius:12px; padding:14px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            <div style=\"width:28px; height:28px; border-radius:50%; background:#ECFDF5; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:800; color:#065F46;\">3</div>\n            <div style=\"font-weight:800; color:#059669;\">Returns</div>\n          </div>\n          <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px;\">\n            <li><b>30-day</b> money-back guarantee.</li>\n            <li>Return items in <b>unopened, resalable condition</b>.</li>\n            <li>Original postage is <b>non-refundable</b>; buyer pays return shipping.</li>\n            <li><b>Contact us first</b> for RMA and instructions.</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px; background:#F0FDF4; border:1px solid #BBF7D0; padding:10px; border-radius:10px; font-size:13px; color:#166534;\">\n            Keep original packaging and include your order ID to speed up processing.\n          </div>\n        </td>\n\n        <!-- Card 4: Support & Feedback -->\n        <td style=\"width:50%; vertical-align:top; background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius:12px; padding:14px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            <div style=\"width:28px; height:28px; border-radius:50%; background:#EFF6FF; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:800; color:#1E40AF;\">4</div>\n            <div style=\"font-weight:800; color:#1E3A8A;\">Support &amp; Feedback</div>\n          </div>\n          <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px;\">\n            <li>Questions or issues? Message us via <b>Contact Seller. </b>We reply promptly.</li>\n            <li>We work hard to resolve problems before delivery is affected.</li>\n            <li>Your feedback helps our small business, thank you!</li>\n            <li><b>Support hours:</b> Messages monitored daily.</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:10px; font-size:12px; color:#6B7280;\">We're here to help? Please reach out before leaving feedback if anything isn't right.</div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <!-- Mini FAQ Row -->\n  <div style=\"margin-top:12px; border:1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius:12px; padding:12px; background:#F9FAFB;\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Quick FAQs</div>\n    <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px; font-size:13px;\">\n      <li><b>Where is my tracking?</b> eBay's order page shows it once dispatched.</li>\n      <li><b>Change of address?</b> Please update your eBay/PayPal address <i>before</i> paying.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Fine print -->\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#6B7280; margin-top:10px; text-align:center;\">\n    *Dispatch time excludes weekends and public holidays. Transit times are estimates and may vary.   </div>\n</div>\n<!--